| 14 | Sensitive Equality | ✅ Clean | No fragile `ToString()` comparisons |
| 15 | Unknown Test | ✅ Clean | All test names describe the scenario |

---

## Positive Observations

- **`sealed` test class** — MSTest 4 best practice, prevents unintended inheritance
- **`[TestCategory("Integration")]`** — properly tagged for selective filtering
- **Per-test isolation** — in-memory SQLite recreated per test via `[TestInitialize]`
- **Resource cleanup** — `_connection.Dispose()` in `[TestCleanup]`
- **Clear `Method_Scenario` naming** convention across all tests
- **Clean AAA structure** in 5 of 8 tests
- **Concurrent-insert test** (`InsertUser_ConcurrentInserts_MaintainsIntegrity`) properly uses `async`/`await`

---

## Priority

| Priority | Fix | Impact |
|----------|-----|--------|
| 🔴 Fix now | Add assertions to `BulkInsert_RunsWithoutErrors` | Eliminates false confidence |
| 🟠 Fix soon | Replace `Thread.Sleep` with polling loop | Eliminates 3 s waste + flakiness |
| 🟠 Fix soon | Split conditional test into two focused tests | Eliminates hidden branches |
| 🟡 Opportunistic | Add assertion messages to `InsertUser_PersistsToDatabase` | Improves failure diagnostics |
